<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠῷος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῴα,
		ῷον</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠοῖος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>at break of day</i>, with Verbs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. γεγονώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέττιξ] ἠ. χέει αὐδήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					396
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Op.</u>
				548
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠῷοι ἔμελλον . . θυμὸν ἀμύξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					3.1.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. ἀλέκτωρ κηρύσσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.2
				</span></i>
			 (Antip. Thess.): without Verbs, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ.
				ὕπνος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.726
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1274
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eastern</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρσης ἀνὴρ ἐπάγων . . τὸν ἠῷον
					στρατόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.157
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἅλα . . ἠῴην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.745
				</span></i>
			.</div>
